Send lines scrolled during a synchronized update to the client as a scroll
instead of redrawing every line of the scroll region.
https://github.com/tmux/tmux/issues/5611
https://github.com/tmux/tmux/commit/7fc7f1bf693ae298253bb0cb9a2047c494ac32d5

